    "name": "fatsecret Image Recognition API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The fatsecret Image Recognition method accepts a Base64-encoded photograph of one or more foods and returns the identified food items, their suggested servings, and the nutritional content eaten, matched against fatsecret's verified nutrition database for the requested region and language. Built on top of large language models and launched in late 2024, it replaced ten years of in-house computer vision work.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: fatsecret Platform",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
